  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 두번째 동아리 시간이였습니다ㅎㅎ<br>AI 챗봇(이번에는 미조우 사용해보았습니다.)을 활용하여, 간단한 센서 실험 주제와 가설, 준비물, 실험 과정, 시뮬레이션 묘사 등을 적도록 했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/de2d350ec9acafef875decad4ed7f9882ada2d47\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/de2d350ec9acafef875decad4ed7f9882ada2d47\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9cfd1281a1dae80cb84661ffcb1c8427268a0c11\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9cfd1281a1dae80cb84661ffcb1c8427268a0c11\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb80bcd42daf4b38579171ef851b65c634333a42\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb80bcd42daf4b38579171ef851b65c634333a42\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c2efd67379f511d142c7255b384ee966e950ee7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c2efd67379f511d142c7255b384ee966e950ee7\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이후, 패들렛에 올리고<br>지도교사(나)가 주제의 보완점을 하나씩 이야기 해주었습니다! 그에 따라, 댓글로 수정사항을 달았죠</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c54f90c2cea8c4531e8701ef16128e681a35ac27\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c54f90c2cea8c4531e8701ef16128e681a35ac27\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54935fb31934f4db8006000b839346b44a3d76da\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54935fb31934f4db8006000b839346b44a3d76da\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/03aea364417eb991bba51079b904d8d8abc80541\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/03aea364417eb991bba51079b904d8d8abc80541\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그리고 이음 AI로 자신의 주제와 맞는<br>예비탐구 시뮬레이션을 제작했습니다.<br>(영서중 AI 선도학교 예산으로 구독한 AI 모음 사이트)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0baf575d9d2b57081cb67ef7a8d374e7de11aa31\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0baf575d9d2b57081cb67ef7a8d374e7de11aa31\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">우리학교에서 사용할 수 있는<br>수온 센서, 접촉 온도 센서, 무게센서, 공기압센서로<br>실험 주제를 잡으라고 해서<br>그에 관련된 내용이 대부분입니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/41446811545447e5389f06ab23db893b35b700c8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/41446811545447e5389f06ab23db893b35b700c8\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4afbc53fd3adabaad2df91391854f75b70e0fcb4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4afbc53fd3adabaad2df91391854f75b70e0fcb4\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59430fd79db2a753c2b8f72c1fe984d4ab9ad1c2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59430fd79db2a753c2b8f72c1fe984d4ab9ad1c2\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a6cc147606edee02562657ddf7f601fcbbe373d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a6cc147606edee02562657ddf7f601fcbbe373d\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e720ed2380d75ecee280df7696903b93c4020c0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e720ed2380d75ecee280df7696903b93c4020c0\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/750000eacdd43dee70603f9464d29e00e7373e48\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/750000eacdd43dee70603f9464d29e00e7373e48\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\